{"seq":1,"slug":"difficulty-curves","title":"难度曲线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-difficulty-balancing/curves/difficulty-curves","wordCount":2153,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"难度曲线\">难度曲线</h1><p>把一整局《超级马力欧兄弟》的难度按关卡画成一条线，你不会得到一条笔直上扬的斜线，而是一条带锯齿、整体向右上、偶尔回落的曲线。这条曲线是基础章那条窄<a href=\"../foundations/flow-channel\">心流通道</a>在时间轴上的投影——因为玩家技能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 随游玩单调上涨，挑战 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 必须跟着抬，才能维持 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = c - s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 停在通道里。这一篇讲整局尺度的宏观走势：曲线该长什么样、它与学习曲线如何咬合、为什么是锯齿而非直线。局部的尖峰与休息留给<a href=\"spikes-valleys\">峰谷与节奏</a>，具体数字留给<a href=\"tuning-numbers\">数值调校</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>这一章开始处理时间维度，先把描述&quot;难度随时间展开&quot;的几个概念定清楚。</p>\n<p><strong>学习曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></strong> 描述玩家技能随游玩时间的增长，通常先快后慢呈对数形。<strong>难度曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></strong> 描述设计师安排的挑战随进度的变化。<strong>感知挑战 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta(t) = c(t) - s(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></strong> 是两者之差，也就是玩家实际体验到的失配度。难度曲线不是孤立的目标，而是一条必须追随学习曲线、并始终略微领先它一个身位的线。曲线的局部形态呈<strong>锯齿（sawtooth）</strong>：宏观上扬，但在新机制引入、章节交替处反复升降。面对&quot;一条曲线服务不了所有人&quot;的困境，应对手段有三层：<strong>多档难度</strong>、<strong>可达性辅助</strong>、<strong>动态适配</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[学习曲线 s_t: 先快后慢] --&gt; C[感知挑战 Delta = c - s]&#10;    B[难度曲线 c_t: 设计师安排] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D{Delta 落点}&#10;    D --&gt;|c 落后于 s| E[无聊: 难度该抬]&#10;    D --&gt;|c 略领先 s| F[心流: 维持]&#10;    D --&gt;|c 远超 s| G[焦虑: 尖峰过陡]&#10;    H[一条曲线服务不了所有人] --&gt; I[多档难度]&#10;    H --&gt; J[可达性辅助]&#10;    H --&gt; K[动态适配]\">flowchart TD\n    A[学习曲线 s_t: 先快后慢] --&gt; C[感知挑战 Delta = c - s]\n    B[难度曲线 c_t: 设计师安排] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D{Delta 落点}\n    D --&gt;|c 落后于 s| E[无聊: 难度该抬]\n    D --&gt;|c 略领先 s| F[心流: 维持]\n    D --&gt;|c 远超 s| G[焦虑: 尖峰过陡]\n    H[一条曲线服务不了所有人] --&gt; I[多档难度]\n    H --&gt; J[可达性辅助]\n    H --&gt; K[动态适配]</pre><p>下表把这几个概念与它们的判定标准并列，便于后文随时回查。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>理想状态</th>\n<th>失衡表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>玩家技能随时间的增长</td>\n<td>先快后慢的对数形</td>\n<td>平直则不符实际</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>难度曲线</td>\n<td>挑战随进度的安排</td>\n<td>追随并略领先学习曲线</td>\n<td>等速直线必失衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>感知挑战</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(t)-s(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，玩家实际体验</td>\n<td>落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0&lt;\\Delta&lt;\\delta_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>过低无聊、过高焦虑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锯齿形态</td>\n<td>宏观上扬、局部反复升降</td>\n<td>新机制先回落再爬升</td>\n<td>单调直线会疲劳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三层应对手段</td>\n<td>多档难度/可达性/动态适配</td>\n<td>常组合使用</td>\n<td>单用一层各有短板</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"难度曲线与学习曲线是一对赛跑选手\">难度曲线与学习曲线是一对赛跑选手</h2><p>容易混淆的两条曲线：<strong>学习曲线</strong>描述玩家技能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随时间的增长，<strong>难度曲线</strong>描述游戏挑战 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随进度的安排。玩家体验到的是两者之差。设计的目标不是让难度曲线好看，而是让它始终略微领先学习曲线一个身位：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(t) = s(t) + \\Delta(t), \\quad 0 &lt; \\Delta(t) &lt; \\delta_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>学习曲线通常是先快后慢的对数形状——新手期进步飞快，熟练后边际递减。如果难度曲线画成等速直线，它会在前期被快速上涨的技能追上（玩家觉得开头太磨），又在后期甩开放缓的技能（玩家觉得结尾太难）。所以一条好的难度曲线，形状应大致追随学习曲线：开头陡一点跟上飞速成长，中后段放缓避免甩开。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[游玩进度 t] --&gt; B[学习曲线 s_t&lt;br/&gt;先快后慢 对数形]&#10;    A --&gt; C[难度曲线 c_t&lt;br/&gt;设计师安排]&#10;    B --&gt; D[感知挑战 Delta = c - s]&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E{Delta 是否在通道内?}&#10;    E --&gt;|c 落后于 s| F[无聊: 难度该抬了]&#10;    E --&gt;|c 略领先 s| G[心流: 维持]&#10;    E --&gt;|c 远超 s| H[焦虑: 难度尖峰过陡]&#10;    F --&gt; I[调整难度曲线斜率&lt;br/&gt;而非乱加数值]&#10;    H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n    A[游玩进度 t] --&gt; B[学习曲线 s_t&lt;br/&gt;先快后慢 对数形]\n    A --&gt; C[难度曲线 c_t&lt;br/&gt;设计师安排]\n    B --&gt; D[感知挑战 Delta = c - s]\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E{Delta 是否在通道内?}\n    E --&gt;|c 落后于 s| F[无聊: 难度该抬了]\n    E --&gt;|c 略领先 s| G[心流: 维持]\n    E --&gt;|c 远超 s| H[焦虑: 难度尖峰过陡]\n    F --&gt; I[调整难度曲线斜率&lt;br/&gt;而非乱加数值]\n    H --&gt; I</pre><p>这也解释了为什么&quot;教程关&quot;必须低难度：开局玩家 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 接近零，任何 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 都可能远超它。教程的本质是用极低的挑战，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 从零拉到能进入正式通道的起点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么是锯齿-而不是直线\">为什么是锯齿，而不是直线</h2><p>观察任何打磨良好的游戏，宏观难度曲线总体上扬，但局部呈锯齿状（sawtooth）反复升降，而非单调直线。这背后有三个独立的理由。</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>新机制的引入会瞬间重置技能。</strong> 当游戏教给玩家一个新道具、新敌人、新动作时，玩家对这个新元素的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 又回到了近零。所以每引入一个新机制，难度都应先回落到一个低点（给玩家安全练习的空间），再随掌握重新爬升。整局曲线于是变成一串&quot;引入—回落—爬升&quot;的小齿。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>节奏需要呼吸。</strong> 持续顶在通道上沿会让玩家疲惫，必须用低谷让玩家消化、收获掌控感、为下一个高峰蓄力。这是<a href=\"spikes-valleys\">峰谷与节奏</a>的主题，宏观曲线在这里只需记住：低谷不是设计失误，而是必需品。</p>\n<p>第三，<strong>章节结构需要起伏。</strong> boss 战、关底、剧情高潮天然是难度尖峰，而它们之间需要平缓的过渡段。曲线的大齿对应章节高潮，小齿对应单个机制。</p>\n<p>下表对比几种常见的整局曲线形态及其适用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>曲线形态</th>\n<th>宏观走势</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平缓锯齿上升</td>\n<td>缓升、小起伏</td>\n<td>休闲、叙事向</td>\n<td>后期可能偏软</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>陡峭锯齿上升</td>\n<td>快升、大起伏</td>\n<td>硬核动作、roguelike</td>\n<td>中段易出现劝退尖峰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阶梯式</td>\n<td>平台期+台阶跳升</td>\n<td>关卡制、章节明确</td>\n<td>台阶过高即难度墙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钟形（先升后稳）</td>\n<td>升到高位后维持</td>\n<td>长线运营、刷子游戏</td>\n<td>封顶后靠内容而非难度留人</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习曲线因人而异-一条曲线服务不了所有人\">学习曲线因人而异：一条曲线服务不了所有人</h2><p>宏观曲线的根本困境是：它对&quot;平均玩家&quot;的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 成立，但真实玩家的学习速度分布极广。同一条曲线，对学得快的老手是无聊的缓坡，对学得慢的新手是劝退的陡坡。下图这条&quot;一条曲线&quot;恰恰是整个 hub 后半部分要破解的核心矛盾。</p>\n<p>应对策略有三层，难度递增也是后续章节的主线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>多档难度</strong>：提供简单/普通/困难若干条平移或变形的曲线，让玩家自选最贴近自己 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的那条。简单但粗糙——玩家很难在游玩前准确判断自己属于哪档。</li>\n<li><strong>可达性辅助</strong>：把曲线的不同维度（执行/认知/策略）拆开让玩家分别调，见<a href=\"../practice/accessibility-difficulty\">可达性难度</a>。更精细，但需要按<a href=\"../foundations/difficulty-types\">难度类型谱</a>拆解设计。</li>\n<li><strong>动态适配</strong>：让系统实时观测玩家表现，自动把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 往玩家个人的通道里拉，见<a href=\"../dynamic/dynamic-difficulty\">动态难度调节</a>。最贴合，但实现复杂且有伦理风险。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三层不是互斥的，许多现代游戏同时使用：先给档位作粗调，再给辅助作精调，可能还叠一层暗中的动态微调。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用关卡顺序而非数值来塑造曲线\">用关卡顺序而非数值来塑造曲线</h2><p>一个常被忽视的要点：宏观难度曲线的形状，很大程度上由关卡/遭遇的<strong>排序</strong>决定，而不只是单个关卡的数值。同样一批已经做好的关卡，换一个出场顺序，整局曲线就完全不同。这给调校提供了一个低成本的杠杆——重排序比重做数值便宜得多。</p>\n<p>排序时几条经验法则：把教学型遭遇放在对应机制的难关之前；把难度尖峰前后各留一个缓冲遭遇（前面让玩家就绪、后面让玩家回血）；避免连续两个高峰不给喘息；让每个新机制经历&quot;安全引入→组合应用→压力测试&quot;三段式。这些都是在不碰数值的前提下塑造曲线的手段。当排序定下后，再用<a href=\"tuning-numbers\">数值调校</a>对单个遭遇做精修，用<a href=\"../practice/difficulty-metrics\">难度度量</a>的关卡通过率数据回头检查曲线哪里出了凸起或凹陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>难度曲线是心流通道在时间轴上的投影：因玩家技能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随游玩上涨，挑战 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 必须跟涨以维持 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0&lt;\\Delta&lt;\\delta_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>难度曲线应追随而非偏离学习曲线（先快后慢的对数形），略领先一个身位；教程关的作用是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 从零拉到通道起点。</li>\n<li>曲线宏观上扬、局部锯齿，源于新机制重置技能、节奏需要呼吸、章节需要起伏三个理由。</li>\n<li>一条曲线服务不了学习速度迥异的所有玩家，应对的三层手段是多档难度、可达性辅助、动态适配，常组合使用。</li>\n<li>关卡排序是塑造曲线的低成本杠杆，重排序比重做数值便宜，定序后再用数值精修、用数据复检。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>上游标尺：<a href=\"../foundations/flow-channel\">心流通道</a></li>\n<li>局部张弛：<a href=\"spikes-valleys\">峰谷与节奏</a></li>\n<li>把曲线落成数字：<a href=\"tuning-numbers\">数值调校</a></li>\n<li>让系统自动贴合个人曲线：<a href=\"../dynamic/dynamic-difficulty\">动态难度调节</a></li>\n<li>关卡端的难度曲线设计（跨库）：<a href=\"../../game-design/level-design/difficulty-curve\">06 游戏设计 · 难度曲线</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"难度曲线","id":"难度曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"难度曲线与学习曲线是一对赛跑选手","id":"难度曲线与学习曲线是一对赛跑选手"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么是锯齿，而不是直线","id":"为什么是锯齿-而不是直线"},{"level":2,"text":"学习曲线因人而异：一条曲线服务不了所有人","id":"学习曲线因人而异-一条曲线服务不了所有人"},{"level":2,"text":"用关卡顺序而非数值来塑造曲线","id":"用关卡顺序而非数值来塑造曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"难度类型谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-difficulty-balancing/foundations/difficulty-types"},"next":{"title":"峰谷与节奏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-difficulty-balancing/curves/spikes-valleys"}}